      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i really dont want to go to the hospital if i dont have to, the wait times are insane and i dont have much money for an ER visit. i've read online that tea tree oil is super antimicrobial so it'll stop any infection from starting. if i just use a really thick layer of it, won't that help keep the air off it and soothe the pain? it seems way more natural and safer than getting poked by doctors.",
